<div class="faq-content">
  <!-- GENERAL -->
  <div class="faq-category">
    <h2 class="faq-category__title">GENERAL</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Is 2INTO9 for me?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>2INTO9 is for anyone looking for breathable support and separation in their underwear. Our innovative dual-pouch design provides unmatched comfort and prevents skin-to-skin contact. Give us a try - we're confident you'll love the difference!</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I find the right size for me?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Check out our <a href="/pages/sizing">sizing charts</a> for detailed measurements. If you're between sizes, we recommend sizing up for a relaxed fit or sizing down for a snugger fit. Consider your body type - if you have a slimmer build, size down; if you're broader, size up.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What is 2INTO9 Underwear made from?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Our underwear is primarily made from 92% Modal / 8% Elastane. Modal is derived from beech tree pulp, making it naturally antimicrobial and incredibly breathable. We also offer Bamboo fabric options which are equally soft and sustainable.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What's different about each type of 2INTO9?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>We offer various styles to suit different preferences:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>8" Boxer Brief:</strong> Our classic length for full coverage and support</li>
            <li><strong>5" Boxer Brief:</strong> Mid-thigh length for those who prefer less coverage</li>
            <li><strong>3" Trunks:</strong> Shorter cut for maximum freedom of movement</li>
            <li><strong>Brief:</strong> Traditional cut with our signature pouch technology</li>
          </ul>
          <p>All styles feature our dual-pouch design for optimal comfort and separation.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Do pouch sizes differ?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Yes, the pouch size increases slightly with the underwear size to maintain proportional comfort. However, the width remains consistent across sizes to ensure the same supportive experience regardless of the size you choose.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I wash my 2INTO9?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>For best results:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Wash in cold water on a gentle cycle</li>
            <li>Wash separately or with like colors</li>
            <li>Use the lowest dryer setting, or better yet, line dry</li>
            <li>Avoid bleach and fabric softeners</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Line drying is the best way to preserve the elastic and extend the life of your underwear.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Do you offer Gift Cards?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Yes! We offer digital gift cards in various denominations. Gift cards are delivered via email and can be used for any purchase on our website. They never expire and make the perfect gift for someone who deserves ultimate comfort.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- RETURNS & EXCHANGES -->
  <div class="faq-category">
    <h2 class="faq-category__title">RETURNS & EXCHANGES</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What is your return policy?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>We offer a "First Pair Guarantee" - if you're not satisfied with your first pair, we'll provide a refund or replacement within 30 days of receiving your order. For hygiene reasons, items must be unworn and in original packaging for standard returns. Please visit our <a href="/pages/returns">Return Policy</a> page for complete details.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Do you have a warranty on your products?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Yes! We offer a 2-Year Manufacturer Warranty covering any defects in fabric, construction, finish, or workmanship. This does not include normal wear and tear, stains from regular use, or damage from improper care. If you believe you have a defective product, please contact us at <a href="mailto:care@2into9.com">care@2into9.com</a> with photos and a description.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What is the process for exchanges?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>To exchange an item, contact us at <a href="mailto:care@2into9.com">care@2into9.com</a>. Once we receive your unopened item back, we'll ship out the replacement. Exchange items must be in original packaging and unworn.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SHIPPING -->
  <div class="faq-category">
    <h2 class="faq-category__title">SHIPPING</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Do you ship internationally?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Yes, we ship to most countries worldwide! International shipping times vary by location, typically 7-21 business days. Please note that customs fees and import duties are the responsibility of the buyer and are not included in our shipping costs.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>What shipping services do you use?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>For domestic orders, we primarily use standard postal services with delivery times of 3-7 business days. For international orders, we use express courier services like DHL or UPS for faster, tracked delivery (7-21 business days depending on destination).</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How can I get free shipping?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>We offer free shipping on qualifying orders! Check our current promotions for the minimum order value required. Subscribe to our newsletter to stay updated on special shipping offers and promotions.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I track my order?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Once your order ships, you'll receive an email with your tracking number and a link to track your package. You can also log into your account on our website to view all your order details and tracking information.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ORDERING -->
  <div class="faq-category">
    <h2 class="faq-category__title">ORDERING</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I enter a discount code?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>At checkout, you'll see a field labeled "Gift Card or discount code". Enter your code there and click "Apply". The discount will be reflected in your order total before you complete your purchase.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Can I stack discount codes?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>No, only one discount code can be used per order. However, gift cards can be used in combination with a discount code since they work as a payment method rather than a discount.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>How do I use my Gift Card?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>Enter your gift card code at checkout in the same field as promotional codes. The gift card value will be applied to your order. If your order total exceeds the gift card value, you can pay the remaining balance with another payment method. Gift cards can be used alongside discount codes.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-item__question">
          <span class="faq-item__icon"></span>
          <span>Can I modify or cancel my order?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-item__answer">
          <p>We process orders quickly, so please contact us at <a href="mailto:care@2into9.com">care@2into9.com</a> as soon as possible if you need to make changes. If your order hasn't shipped yet, we'll do our best to accommodate your request. Once shipped, changes cannot be made.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
